    "semantic_summary": "DropdownComponent is a presentation layer Angular component responsible for rendering an interactive selection menu. It manages its visibility state (`isOpen`) and handles user selection events by emitting the chosen item via the `itemSelected` output. Architecturally, it consumes item data via `@Input()` properties (`items`, `selectedItem`) and implements lifecycle hooks to manage global DOM event listeners for closing the dropdown when clicking outside."
